# Strings for templates/process-diagram.html and tools/build_process_diagram.py.
# Format: see tools/i18n.py. nb is what the page said before --lang existed.
# _one / _other: the form for exactly one, and for any other count. nb keeps its old
# wording for both, so a diagram with one role still says '1 roller' in nb.
# pct_suffix starts with a space in nb: the value is everything after the first '= '.

